      <div class="overlay"></div>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="tag">Jabalbina · QLD</span>
        <h3>The Daintree<br>Restoration</h3>
        <p>Regenerating 1,200 ha of rainforest alongside the Eastern Kuku Yalanji rangers program.</p>
